MetroDef3D benchmark inference

Model implementations are copied without architectural changes from the original
training code (model.py and benchmark_models.py). Source hashes and checkpoint provenance
are supplied in each model asset. The code is distributed under Apache-2.0,
consistent with MetroDef3D. The CNN implementation uses torchvision's ResNet-50
and ConvNeXt-Tiny implementations (torchvision is BSD-3-Clause); no torchvision
pretrained weights are included. Reference predictions and study data retain
the MetroDef3D studies' CC BY 4.0 license.
